# Halcyon: Lynis audits run as root, and Homebrew refuses to run as root, so
# PKGS-7303 (`brew list --versions`) only errors out. Brew packages live in the
# user's home and are not part of the image's audited package set.
skip-test=PKGS-7303

# Halcyon: CRYP-8005 only checks for a running haveged, audio-entropyd or
# jitterentropy-rngd process. The kernel CSPRNG is already fully seeded and
# rngd feeds the TPM RNG into it, so haveged would add nothing.
skip-test=CRYP-8005

# Halcyon: PKGS-7420 only looks for auter, yum-cron, dnf-automatic or
# unattended-upgrade. This is a bootc image: uupd is the automatic updater and
# rpm-ostree's own automatic policy is deliberately none, so dnf-automatic does
# not apply.
skip-test=PKGS-7420
